+/*
+ * Set OEM flags
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2018 Samsung Electronics, Inc.
+ * Phung Xuan Chien, <phung.chien@samsung.com>
+ * Nguyen Hoang Thai Kiet, <kiet.nht@samsung.com>
+ *
