+/******************************************************************************
+*
+* This group of IOCTLs deal with the Acoustic Echo Cancellation settings
+* of the DSP
+*
+* Issuing the IXJCTL_AEC_START command with a value of AEC_OFF has the
+* same effect as IXJCTL_AEC_STOP.  This is to simplify slider bar
